{
  "info": {
    "name": "Life Dashboard API - Auth",
    "description": "Authentication endpoints for Life Dashboard API. Base URL: http://localhost:3001/api/v1",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "life-dashboard"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "📋 Auth Flow",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\",\n  \"displayName\": \"{{userDisplayName}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new user. Sends a 6-digit verification code to the email.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `email` (string, required): Valid email address\n- `password` (string, required): Min 8 characters\n- `displayName` (string, required): Max 64 characters\n\n**Response (201):**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"message\": \"Registration successful. Please check your email for the verification code.\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}\n```\n\n**Errors:**\n- `409 Conflict`: Email already registered"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"displayName\": \"John Doe\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register"
                }
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"message\": \"Registration successful. Please check your email for the verification code.\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Email Already Exists",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"existing@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"displayName\": \"John Doe\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register"
                }
              },
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 409,\n  \"message\": \"Email is already registered\",\n  \"error\": \"Conflict\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/v1/auth/register\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Verify Email",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{verificationCode}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "verify-email"]
            },
            "description": "Verify email address with the 6-digit OTP code sent via email.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `email` (string, required): The email address to verify\n- `code` (string, required): 6-digit verification code\n\n**Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"message\": \"Email verified successfully. You can now log in.\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}\n```\n\n**Errors:**\n- `400 Bad Request`: Invalid email or code\n- `401 Unauthorized`: Code expired or invalid"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"code\": \"482910\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email"
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"message\": \"Email verified successfully. You can now log in.\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Already Verified",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"verified@example.com\",\n  \"code\": \"482910\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email"
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"message\": \"Email is already verified. You can log in.\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2b. Resend Verification (Optional)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "resend-verification"]
            },
            "description": "Resend the email verification code. Rate-limited to 1 request per minute.\n\n**Security Note:** Always returns 200 regardless of whether the email exists to prevent user enumeration.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `email` (string, required): Email address to resend code to\n\n**Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"message\": \"A new verification code has been sent to your email.\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Store tokens from response for subsequent requests",
                  "const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (response.data && response.data.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('accessToken', response.data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('refreshToken', response.data.refreshToken);",
                  "    console.log('Tokens stored in environment');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login with email and password. Only verified users can obtain tokens.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `email` (string, required): Valid email address\n- `password` (string, required): User password\n\n**Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...\",\n    \"expiresIn\": 900\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}\n```\n\n**Token Details:**\n- `accessToken`: Valid for 15 minutes (900 seconds)\n- `refreshToken`: Valid for 7 days\n\n**Errors:**\n- `401 Unauthorized`: Invalid credentials or email not verified"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n    \"expiresIn\": 900\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Email Not Verified",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"unverified@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
                }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 401,\n  \"message\": \"Email not verified. Please check your inbox for the verification code.\",\n  \"error\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/v1/auth/login\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Invalid Credentials",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"wrongpassword\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
                }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"statusCode\": 401,\n  \"message\": \"Invalid credentials\",\n  \"error\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/v1/auth/login\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Get Profile (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Get the current authenticated user's profile.\n\n**Headers:**\n- `Authorization`: Bearer {accessToken}\n\n**Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"507f1f77bcf86cd799439011\",\n    \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n    \"displayName\": \"John Doe\",\n    \"isEmailVerified\": true,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}\n```\n\n**Errors:**\n- `401 Unauthorized`: Missing or invalid access token"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs..."
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me"
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"507f1f77bcf86cd799439011\",\n    \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n    \"displayName\": \"John Doe\",\n    \"isEmailVerified\": true,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Complete authentication flow: Register → Verify Email → Login → Access protected endpoints"
    },
    {
      "name": "🔐 Token Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Update tokens with new ones from refresh response",
                  "const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (response.data && response.data.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('accessToken', response.data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('refreshToken', response.data.refreshToken);",
                  "    console.log('Tokens refreshed and stored');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{refreshToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Rotate tokens using a valid refresh token. Returns new access and refresh tokens.\n\n**Headers:**\n- `Authorization`: Bearer {refreshToken}\n\n**Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...\",\n    \"expiresIn\": 900\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}\n```\n\n**Note:** The old refresh token is invalidated after rotation.\n\n**Errors:**\n- `401 Unauthorized`: Invalid or expired refresh token"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Clear tokens after logout",
                  "pm.environment.set('accessToken', '');",
                  "pm.environment.set('refreshToken', '');",
                  "console.log('Tokens cleared from environment');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Logout and invalidate the refresh token.\n\n**Headers:**\n- `Authorization`: Bearer {accessToken}\n\n**Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"message\": \"Logged out successfully\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\"\n}\n```\n\n**Note:** The access token remains valid until it expires (15 minutes), but the refresh token is immediately invalidated."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Token rotation and session management endpoints"
    },
    {
      "name": "⚠️ Error Examples",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Validation Error (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"invalid-email\",\n  \"password\": \"123\",\n  \"displayName\": \"\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Example of validation error response when request body is invalid.\n\n**Response (400):**\n```json\n{\n  \"statusCode\": 400,\n  \"message\": [\n    \"email must be an email\",\n    \"password must be longer than or equal to 8 characters\",\n    \"displayName should not be empty\"\n  ],\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/v1/auth/register\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Unauthorized (401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer invalid_token"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Example of unauthorized error when access token is invalid or expired.\n\n**Response (401):**\n```json\n{\n  \"statusCode\": 401,\n  \"message\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"error\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/v1/auth/me\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Missing Auth Header (401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Example error when accessing protected endpoint without authorization header.\n\n**Response (401):**\n```json\n{\n  \"statusCode\": 401,\n  \"message\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"error\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-21T10:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/v1/auth/me\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Example error responses for reference"
    }
  ],
